# Stable spec ID: iba-mai-tai. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(rum; amber Jamaican) 30 ml
(rum; Martinique molasses) 30 ml
(orange curaçao) 15 ml
(orgeat syrup, almond) 15 ml
(lime: juice, fresh) 30 ml
(simple syrup) 7.5 ml

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(double rocks glass)
(highball glass)
(serving glass) = (double rocks glass) -OR- (highball glass)

::instructions
<shake, all measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<pour, into the chosen (serving glass)>
<garnish, with pineapple spear and mint leaves and lime peel>

::notes
The source distinguishes molasses Martinique rum from agricole for the historical profile; this is style evidence, not a product requirement.
Named products use bare @ unless a stronger intent is explicitly authored. No automatic substitution is implied.

